/-- [DIR], §6.2.1: for $h>0$ (and $\alpha_i=\alpha_i(\frac12)$),
$$g_{Q,1,\frac12}(h,y)=\tfrac12Q_{\frac12}(y)^{-1}-(\alpha_0+4\alpha_1y)+2\alpha_1h
