      iteratedDeriv 3 (f_QIII_0 β) y =
        iteratedDeriv 3 (f_QIII_1 β) y * f_QIII_2 β y
          + 3 * deriv (deriv (f_QIII_1 β)) y * deriv (f_QIII_2 β) y
          + 3 * deriv (f_QIII_1 β) y * deriv (deriv (f_QIII_2 β)) y := by
  sorry

